The main test script is test.sh. Users can get help by running ./test.sh -?

    -F is used to assign the data setting
    -f is used to set database specific setting
    -a is used to set action to take. 0 for insert, 1 for query

Example:
    ./test.sh -F cases/config_case1.sh -f cases/tdengine_case1.sh
    case 1:
      100 tables 100000000 records

    ./test.sh -F cases/config_case2.sh -f cases/tdengine_case2.sh
    case 2:
      1 table 100000000 records

    ./test.sh -F cases/config_case3.sh -f cases/tdengine_case3.sh
    case 3:
      100 table 10000000 records

    ./test.sh -F cases/config_case4.sh -f cases/tdengine_case4.sh
    case 4:
      1 table 10000000000 records

  To query:
    ./test.sh -f cases/config_case1.sh -a 1
